{"3828880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Goofy Golfette", "steam_appid": 3828880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goofy Golfette: </strong>Crazy golf-kart <strong>battles</strong> in a chaotic <strong>score race</strong> ! Blast your way  to victory (and maybe a few friendships)  with <strong>nitro</strong>-fueled <strong>dashes</strong>, charged shots, and unique golf-cart <strong>skills</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>💯<u> SCORE </u>💯</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win, score the most points and for that you will have to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blow up</strong> your friends <i><span class=\"bb_strike\">(nicely huh)</span></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put balls in <strong>holes</strong> <i>(the real objective of golf, it seems)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid dying <i>(it’s better, but not mandatory.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/0e21a119c85065c74a55a9d1c6fb0049.poster.avif?t=1769502871\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/0e21a119c85065c74a55a9d1c6fb0049.webm?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/0e21a119c85065c74a55a9d1c6fb0049.mp4?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🔥<u> NITRO, <i>baby! </i></u>🔥</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reap chaos, you will need <u>NITROOO</u> !!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>pick them up</strong> on the map or collect it by putting <strong>balls in holes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Nitro is the hot sauce of your golf cart: without it, you won't last long.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/136e349af595363ef450b33b8823b882.poster.avif?t=1769502871\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/136e349af595363ef450b33b8823b882.webm?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/136e349af595363ef450b33b8823b882.mp4?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>💥<u> ACTION <i>(and réactions) </i></u>💥</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With some Nitro, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash</strong> to avoid projectiles <i>(or just to show off)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot <strong>Charged Balls</strong> at others</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/27ad3fed55e50be6bb70df7115e0d5db.poster.avif?t=1769502871\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/27ad3fed55e50be6bb70df7115e0d5db.webm?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/27ad3fed55e50be6bb70df7115e0d5db.mp4?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>😵<u> BAM, DAZED ! </u>😵</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run into an <u>obstacle</u> or a well-placed <u>ball</u> ? Result : <strong>dazed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your &quot;Racing car&quot; slows like a turtle, and the <strong><u>wave of fire</u></strong> behind you is already catching up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/13b047457a1bcfc0825ab7992645cf29.poster.avif?t=1769502871\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/13b047457a1bcfc0825ab7992645cf29.webm?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/13b047457a1bcfc0825ab7992645cf29.mp4?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🏆<u> PROGRESSION : <i>style above all </i></u>🏆</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By playing like a boss, you will unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Golf-karts</strong> with <u>unique</u> skills</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 Wacky maps</strong> full of <u>surprises</u></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Klaxons</strong> that make you <u>laugh</u> <i>(or not ..)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>23 Slamming Skins</strong> <i>(because swag is important)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/014e0a1651bf46a251418435c8abc5fb.poster.avif?t=1769502871\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/014e0a1651bf46a251418435c8abc5fb.webm?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/014e0a1651bf46a251418435c8abc5fb.mp4?t=1769502871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, ready to burn the grass, humiliate your friends and <i>(potentially)</i> play golf?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come on, put this game on your <strong>WISHLIST</strong> and you’ll be notified as soon as it’s ready!! <strong><i><u>(december 2025)</u></i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goofy Golfette: </strong>Crazy golf-kart <strong>battles</strong> in a chaotic <strong>score race</strong> ! Blast your way  to victory (and maybe a few friendships)  with <strong>nitro</strong>-fueled <strong>dashes</strong>, charged shots, and unique golf-cart <strong>skills</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>💯<u> SCORE </u>💯</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win, score the most points and for that you will have to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blow up</strong> your friends <i><span class=\"bb_strike\">(nicely huh)</span></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put balls in <strong>holes</strong> <i>(the real objective of golf, it seems)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid dying <i>(it’s better, but not mandatory.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828880/extras/0e21a119c85065c74a55a9d1c6fb0049.poster.avif?t=1769502871\" width=800 height